#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:1
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Server name (ServerName)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The hostname of your server, as advertised to the world.\n"
"By default CUPS will use the hostname of the system.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"To set the default server used by clients, see the client.conf file.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: myhost.domain.com</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Nome do servidor (ServerName)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O nome do seu servidor, como se anuncia en público.\n"
"De maneira predeterminada CUPS usará o nome de máquina do sistema.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Para configurar o servidor predeterminado usado polos clientes, consulte o "
"ficheiro client.conf.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: omeuequipo.dominio.com</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:11
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Server administrator (ServerAdmin)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The email address to send all complaints or problems to.\n"
"By default CUPS will use \"root@hostname\".</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: root@myhost.com</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Administrador do servidor (ServerAdmin)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O enderezo de correo electrónico ao que enviar as queixas ou problemas.\n"
"De maneira predeterminada CUPS usará «root@hostname».</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: root@omeuequipo.com</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:19
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Access log (AccessLog)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The access log file; if this does not start with a leading /\n"
"then it is assumed to be relative to ServerRoot.  By default set to\n"
"\"/var/log/cups/access_log\".</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"You can also use the special name <b>syslog</b> to send the output to the\n"
"syslog file or daemon.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: /var/log/cups/access_log</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Rexistro de accesos (AccessLog)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O ficheiro de rexistro de accesos; se non comeza con unha barra /\n"
"asumirase que é un relativo a ServerRoot. De maneira predeterminada\n"
"«/var/log/cups/access_log».</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Tamén pode usar o nome especial <b>syslog</b> para enviar a saída\n"
"ao daemon ou ficheiro syslog.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: /var/log/cups/access_log</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:31
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Data directory (DataDir)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The root directory for the CUPS data files.\n"
"By default /usr/share/cups.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: /usr/share/cups</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Directorio de datos (DataDir)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O directorio raíz para os ficheiros de datos de CUPS.\n"
"De maneira predeterminada /usr/share/cups.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: /usr/share/cups</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:39
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Default character set (DefaultCharset)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The default character set to use. If not specified,\n"
"defaults to utf-8.  Note that this can also be overridden in\n"
"HTML documents...</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: utf-8</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Conxunto de caracteres predeterminado (DefaultCharset)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O conxunto de caracteres a usar de maneira predeterminada. Se non se "
"especifica,\n"
"asumirase utf-8. Lembre que isto tamén pode ser sobreposto en \n"
"documentos HTML…</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: utf-8</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:48
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Default language (DefaultLanguage)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The default language if not specified by the browser.\n"
"If not specified, the current locale is used.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: en</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Idioma predeterminado (DefaultLanguage)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O idioma predeterminado se non o especifica o navegador.\n"
"Se non é especificado, utilizarase o locale actual.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: gl</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:56
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Document directory (DocumentRoot)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The root directory for HTTP documents that are served.\n"
"By default the compiled-in directory.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: /usr/share/cups/doc</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Directorio dos documentos (DocumentRoot)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O directorio raíz dos documentos HTTP que son servidos.\n"
"De maneira predeterminada, o indicado durante a compilación.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: /usr/share/cups/doc</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:64
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Error log (ErrorLog)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The error log file; if this does not start with a leading /\n"
"then it is assumed to be relative to ServerRoot.  By default set to\n"
"\"/var/log/cups/error_log\".</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"You can also use the special name <b>syslog</b> to send the output to the\n"
"syslog file or daemon.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: /var/log/cups/error_log</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Rexistro de erros (ErrorLog)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O ficheiro de rexistro de erros; se non comeza cunha barra /\n"
"asumirase que é relativo a ServerRoot. De maneira predeterminada\n"
"«/var/log/cups/error_log».</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Tamén pode usar o nome especial <b>syslog</b> para enviar a saída ao\n"
"ficheiro ou daemon syslog.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: /var/log/cups/error_log</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:76
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Font path (FontPath)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The path to locate all font files (currently only for pstoraster).\n"
"By default /usr/share/cups/fonts.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: /usr/share/cups/fonts</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Ruta dos tipos de letra (FontPath)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"A ruta onde atopar todos os ficheiros de tipo de letra\n"
"(na actualidade só para pstoraster).\n"
"Predeterminada: /usr/share/cups/fonts.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>Exemplo</i>: /usr/share/cups/fonts</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:84
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Log level (LogLevel)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Controls the number of messages logged to the ErrorLog\n"
"file and can be one of the following:</p>\n"
"<ul type=circle>\n"
"<li><i>debug2</i>:     Log everything.</li>\n"
"<li><i>debug</i>:     Log almost everything.</li>\n"
"<li><i>info</i>:      Log all requests and state changes.</li>\n"
"<li><i>warn</i>:      Log errors and warnings.</li>\n"
"<li><i>error</i>:     Log only errors.</li>\n"
"<li><i>none</i>:      Log nothing.</li>\n"
"</ul><p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: info</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Nivel de rexistro (LogLevel)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Controla o número de mensaxes rexistradas no ficheiro ErrorLog\n"
" e pode ser un dos seguintes:</p>\n"
"<ul type=circle>\n"
"<li><i>debug2</i>:     Rexistra todo.</li>\n"
"<li><i>debug</i>:     Rexistra case que todo.</li>\n"
"<li><i>info</i>:      Rexistra todos os pedidos e cambios de estado.</li>\n"
"<li><i>warn</i>:      Rexistra erros e avisos.</li>\n"
"<li><i>error</i>:     Rexistra só os erros.</li>\n"
"<li><i>none</i>:      Non rexistra nada.</li>\n"
"</ul><p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: info</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:99
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Max log size (MaxLogSize)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Controls the maximum size of each log file before they are\n"
"rotated.  Defaults to 1048576 (1MB).  Set to 0 to disable log rotating.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: 1048576</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Tamaño máximo do rexistro (MaxLogSize)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Controla o tamaño máximo de cada ficheiro de rexistro antes de que sexan\n"
"rotados. De maneira predeterminada 1048576 (1MB).  Axuste a 0 para "
"desactivar a rotación do rexistro.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: 1048576</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:107
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Page log (PageLog)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The page log file; if this does not start with a leading /\n"
"then it is assumed to be relative to ServerRoot.  By default set to\n"
"\"/var/log/cups/page_log\".</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"You can also use the special name <b>syslog</b> to send the output to the\n"
"syslog file or daemon.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: /var/log/cups/page_log</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Rexistro de páxinas (PageLog)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O ficheiro de rexistro de páxinas; se non comeza cunha barra /\n"
"asumirase que é relativo a ServerRoot. De maneira predeterminada\n"
"«/var/log/cups/page_log».</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Tamén pode usar o nome especial <b>syslog</b> para enviar a saída ao \n"
"ficheiro ou daemon syslog.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: /var/log/cups/page_log</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:119
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Preserve job history (PreserveJobHistory)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Whether or not to preserve the job history after a\n"
"job is completed, canceled, or stopped.  Default is Yes.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: Yes</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Preservar a historia de traballo (PreserveJobHistory)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Preservar ou non o historial de traballo despois de que\n"
"este se complete, cancele ou pare.  De maneira predeterminada Si.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: Yes</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:127
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Preserve job files (PreserveJobFiles)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Whether or not to preserve the job files after a\n"
"job is completed, canceled, or stopped.  Default is No.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: No</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Preservar os ficheiros de traballo (PreserveJobFiles)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Preservar ou non os ficheiros de traballo despois de que este\n"
"sexa completado, cancelado ou parado.  De maneira predeterminada Non.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: No</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:135
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Printcap file (Printcap)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The name of the printcap file.  Default is no filename.\n"
"Leave blank to disable printcap file generation.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: /etc/printcap</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Ficheiro Printcap (Printcap)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O nome do ficheiro printcap.  De maneira predeterminada non hai tal nome.\n"
"Déixeo en branco para desactivar a xeración de ficheiros printcap.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: /etc/printcap</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:143
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Request directory (RequestRoot)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The directory where request files are stored.\n"
"By default /var/spool/cups.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: /var/spool/cups</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Directorio de pedidos (RequestRoot)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O directorio onde se gardan os pedidos de impresión.\n"
"De maneira predeterminada /var/spool/cups.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: /var/spool/cups</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:151
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Remote root user (RemoteRoot)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The name of the user assigned to unauthenticated accesses\n"
"from remote systems.  By default \"remroot\".</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: remroot</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Usuario root remoto (RemoteRoot)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O nome do usuario asignado a accesos non autenticados\n"
"procedentes de sistemas remotos. De maneira predeterminada «remroot».</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: remroot</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:159
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Server binaries (ServerBin)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The root directory for the scheduler executables.\n"
"By default /usr/lib/cups or /usr/lib32/cups (IRIX 6.5).</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: /usr/lib/cups</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Binarios do servidor (ServerBin)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O directorio raíz dos executábeis do planificador.\n"
"De maneira predeterminada /usr/lib/cups ou /usr/lib32/cups (IRIX 6.5).</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: /usr/lib/cups</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:167
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Server files (ServerRoot)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The root directory for the scheduler.\n"
"By default /etc/cups.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: /etc/cups</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Ficheiros do servidor (ServerRoot)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O directorio raíz para o planificador.\n"
"De maneira predeterminada /etc/cups.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: /etc/cups</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:175
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>User (User)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The user the server runs under.  Normally this\n"
"must be <b>lp</b>, however you can configure things for another user\n"
"as needed.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Note: the server must be run initially as root to support the\n"
"default IPP port of 631.  It changes users whenever an external\n"
"program is run...</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: lp</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Usuario (User)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O usuario que executa o servidor. Normalmente isto\n"
"debe ser <b>lp</b>, porén pode configuralo para outro usuario\n"
"se o necesita.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Nota: o servidor debe ser executado inicialmente como root para permitir\n"
"usar o valor predeterminado do porto IPP de 631. Cambia os usuarios sempre\n"
"que se executa un programa externo…</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: lp</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:188
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Group (Group)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The group the server runs under.  Normally this\n"
"must be <b>sys</b>, however you can configure things for another\n"
"group as needed.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: sys</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Grupo (Group)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O grupo que executa o servidor. Normalmente isto\n"
"debe ser <b>sys</b>, porén pode configuralo para usar outro\n"
"se o necesita.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: sys</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:197
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>RIP cache (RIPCache)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The amount of memory that each RIP should use to cache\n"
"bitmaps.  The value can be any real number followed by \"k\" for\n"
"kilobytes, \"m\" for megabytes, \"g\" for gigabytes, or \"t\" for tiles\n"
"(1 tile = 256x256 pixels).  Defaults to \"8m\" (8 megabytes).</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: 8m</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Caché de RIP (RIPCache)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"A cantidade de memoria que usará cada RIP para cachear\n"
"bitmaps. O valor pode ser calquera número real seguido por un «k» \n"
"no caso de kilobytes, «m» para megabytes, «g» para gigabytes, ou «t» para "
"mosaico\n"
"(1 mosaico = 256x256 pixels). De maneira predeterminada «8m» (8 megabytes).</"
"p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: 8m</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:207
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Temporary files (TempDir)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The directory to put temporary files in. This directory must be\n"
"writable by the user defined above!  Defaults to \"/var/spool/cups/tmp\" or\n"
"the value of the TMPDIR environment variable.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: /var/spool/cups/tmp</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Ficheiros temporais (TempDir)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O directorio onde pór os ficheiros temporais. Neste directorio o usuario\n"
"indicado enriba debe ter permiso de escritura! De maneira predeterminada\n"
"«/var/spool/cups/tmp» ou o valor da variábel de ambiente TMPDIR.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: /var/spool/cups/tmp</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:216
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Filter limit (FilterLimit)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Sets the maximum cost of all job filters that can be run\n"
"at the same time.  A limit of 0 means no limit.  A typical job may need\n"
"a filter limit of at least 200; limits less than the minimum required\n"
"by a job force a single job to be printed at any time.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The default limit is 0 (unlimited).</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: 200</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Límite dos filtros (FilterLimit)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Axusta o custo máximo dos filtros de traballo que poden usarse \n"
"ao mesmo tempo. Un límite de 0 significa ilimitado. Un traballo típico \n"
"pode necesitar un límite de polo menos 200; límites inferiores ao mínimo \n"
"requirido por un traballo \n"
"obrigarán a que só se imprima un traballo á vez.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O límite predeterminado é  0 (sen límite).</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: 200</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:228
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Listen to (Port/Listen)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Ports/addresses that are listened to.  The default port 631 is reserved\n"
"for the Internet Printing Protocol (IPP) and is what is used here.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"You can have multiple Port/Listen lines to listen to more than one\n"
"port or address, or to restrict access.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Note: Unfortunately, most web browsers don't support TLS or HTTP Upgrades\n"
"for encryption.  If you want to support web-based encryption you will\n"
"probably need to listen on port 443 (the \"HTTPS\" port...).</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: 631, myhost:80, 1.2.3.4:631</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Escoitar en (Port/Listen)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Portos/enderezos que son escoitados. O porto predeterminado, o 631, está \n"
"reservado para o Protocolo de Impresión at través de Internet (IPP) e é o \n"
"usado aquí.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Pode ter múltiplas liñas Port/Listen para escoitar a máis dun porto\n"
"ou enderezo, ou para restrinxir o acceso.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Nota: Por desgraza a maioría dos navegadores  web non permiten \n"
"anovacións TLS nin HTTP para cifrar. Se quere permitir a cifrado \n"
"baseada na web probabelmente necesitará escoitar no porto 443 (o porto \n"
"«HTTPS»…).</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: 631, myhost:80, 1.2.3.4:631</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:243
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Hostname lookups (HostNameLookups)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Whether or not to do lookups on IP addresses to get a\n"
"fully-qualified hostname.  This defaults to Off for performance reasons...</"
"p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: On</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Buscas de nomes de máquinas (HostNameLookups)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Facer ou non buscas de enderezos IP para obter \n"
"un nome de máquina completo. O valor predeterminado é «Off» por motivos \n"
"de rendemento…</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: On</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:251
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Keep alive (KeepAlive)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Whether or not to support the Keep-Alive connection\n"
"option.  Default is on.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: On</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Manter vivo (KeepAlive)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Opción para permitir ou non conexións Keep-Alive.\n"
"De maneira predeterminada axustado a «on».</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: On</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:259
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Keep-alive timeout (KeepAliveTimeout)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The timeout (in seconds) before Keep-Alive connections are\n"
"automatically closed.  Default is 60 seconds.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: 60</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Tempo límite de manter vivo (KeepAliveTimeout)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O tempo (en segundos) antes de que as conexións Keep-Alive \n"
"sexan pechadas automaticamente. De maneira predeterminada 60 segundos.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: 60</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:267
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Max clients (MaxClients)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Controls the maximum number of simultaneous clients that\n"
"will be handled.  Defaults to 100.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: 100</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Máx. nº de clientes (MaxClients)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Controla o número máximo de clientes que poderán ser manexados \n"
"simultaneamente. De maneira predeterminada 100.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: 100</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:275
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Max request size (MaxRequestSize)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Controls the maximum size of HTTP requests and print files.\n"
"Set to 0 to disable this feature (defaults to 0).</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: 0</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Tamaño máx. do pedido (MaxRequestSize)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Controla o tamaño máximo das peticións HTTP e dos ficheiros de impresión.\n"
"Axuste a 0 para desactivar esta característica (0 de maneira predeterminada)."
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: 0</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:283
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Client timeout (Timeout)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The timeout (in seconds) before requests time out.  Default is 300 seconds.</"
"p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: 300</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Tempo para a desconexión do cliente (Timeout)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O tempo (en segundos) antes de que os pedidos caduquen. De maneira "
"predeterminada 300 segundos.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: 300</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:290
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Use browsing (Browsing)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Whether or not to <b>listen</b> to printer \n"
"information from other CUPS servers.  \n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Enabled by default.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Note: to enable the <b>sending</b> of browsing\n"
"information from this CUPS server to the LAN,\n"
"specify a valid <i>BrowseAddress</i>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: On</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Usar navegación (Browsing)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Determina se <b>escoitar</b> ou non a información \n"
"das impresoras de outros servidores CUPS.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"De maneira predeterminada permítese.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Nota: para permitir o <b>envío</b> de información \n"
"de navegación desde este servidor CUPS cara á LAN, \n"
"especifique un<i>BrowseAddress</i> correcto.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: On</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:307
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Use short names (BrowseShortNames)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Whether or not to use \"short\" names for remote printers\n"
"when possible (e.g. \"printer\" instead of \"printer@host\").  Enabled by\n"
"default.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: Yes</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Usar nomes curtos (BrowseShortNames)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Usar ou non nomes «curtos» para as impresoras remotas \n"
"cando sexa posíbel (ex. «impresora» no canto de «printer@host»). \n"
"De maneira predeterminada permítese.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: Yes</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:316
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Browse addresses (BrowseAddress)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Specifies a broadcast address to be used.  By\n"
"default browsing information is broadcast to all active interfaces.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Note: HP-UX 10.20 and earlier do not properly handle broadcast unless\n"
"you have a Class A, B, C, or D netmask (i.e. no CIDR support).</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: x.y.z.255, x.y.255.255</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Enderezos de navegación (BrowseAddress)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Especifica un enderezo de difusión. \n"
"De maneira predeterminada, a información de busca difúndese a todas as "
"interfaces \n"
"activas.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Nota: HP-UX 10.20 e anteriores non xestionaban correctamente a difusión \n"
"se non tiña unha máscara de rede das clases A, B, C, ou D  (é dicir, non \n"
"tiña compatibilidade con CIDR).</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: x.y.z.255, x.y.255.255</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:327
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Browse allow/deny (BrowseAllow/BrowseDeny)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<u>BrowseAllow</u>: specifies an address mask to allow for incoming browser\n"
"packets. The default is to allow packets from all addresses.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<u>BrowseDeny</u>: specifies an address mask to deny for incoming browser\n"
"packets. The default is to deny packets from no addresses.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Both \"BrowseAllow\" and \"BrowseDeny\" accept the following notations for\n"
"addresses:</p>\n"
"<pre>\n"
"All\n"
"None\n"
"*.domain.com\n"
".domain.com\n"
"host.domain.com\n"
"nnn.*\n"
"nnn.nnn.*\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.*\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.nnn\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.nnn/mm\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.nnn/mmm.mmm.mmm.mmm\n"
"</pre><p>\n"
"The hostname/domainname restrictions only work if you have turned hostname\n"
"lookups on!</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Permitir/Denegar Navegación  (BrowseAllow/BrowseDeny)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<u>BrowseAllow</u>: especifica unha máscara de enderezos desde os que se \n"
"permitirá a chegada de paquetes de navegación. De maneira predeterminada "
"permítese desde \n"
"todos os enderezos.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<u>BrowseDeny</u>: especifica unha máscara de enderezos aos que se lles \n"
"denegará a entrada dos seus paquetes de navegación. \n"
"De maneira predeterminada non se lle denegará a ningún enderezo.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Ambas as dúas «BrowseAllow» e «BrowseDeny» aceptan as seguintes \n"
"notacións para os enderezos:</p>\n"
"<pre>\n"
"All\n"
"None\n"
"*.domain.com\n"
".domain.com\n"
"host.domain.com\n"
"nnn.*\n"
"nnn.nnn.*\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.*\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.nnn\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.nnn/mm\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.nnn/mmm.mmm.mmm.mmm\n"
"</pre><p>\n"
"As restricións hostname/domainname só funcionan se permite buscas\n"
"de nomes!</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:354
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Browse interval (BrowseInterval)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The time between browsing updates in seconds.  Default\n"
"is 30 seconds.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Note that browsing information is sent whenever a printer's state changes\n"
"as well, so this represents the maximum time between updates.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Set this to 0 to disable outgoing broadcasts so your local printers are\n"
"not advertised but you can still see printers on other hosts.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: 30</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Intervalo de navegación (BrowseInterval)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O período entre actualizacións da navegación en segundos. De maneira "
"predeterminada \n"
"son 30 segundos.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Lembre que a información de navegación tamén é enviada sempre que o \n"
"estado dunha impresora cambie, así que isto representa o período máximo \n"
"entre actualizacións.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Axústeo a 0 para desactivar a difusión saínte de tal maneira que as súas \n"
"impresoras locais non serán anunciadas pero aínda poderá ver as \n"
"impresoras de outras máquinas.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>Por exemplo: 30</i></p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:368
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Browse order (BrowseOrder)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Specifies the order of BrowseAllow/BrowseDeny comparisons.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: allow,deny</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Orde de navegación (BrowseOrder)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Especifica a orde das comparacións de BrowseAllow/BrowseDeny.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: allow,deny</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:375
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Browse poll (BrowsePoll)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Poll the named server(s) for printers.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: myhost:631</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Consulta de navegación (BrowsePoll)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Consulta os servidor(es) de nomes para as impresoras.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: myhost:631</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:382
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Browse port (BrowsePort)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The port used for UDP broadcasts.  By default this is\n"
"the IPP port; if you change this you need to do it on all servers.\n"
"Only one BrowsePort is recognized.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: 631</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Porto de navegación (BrowsePort)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O porto utilizado para difusión UDP. De maneira predeterminada este é o \n"
"porto IPP; se cambia este necesitará facelo en todos os servidores.\n"
"Só se recoñece un BrowsePort.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: 631</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:391
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Browse relay (BrowseRelay)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Relay browser packets from one address/network to another.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: src-address dest-address</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Retransmitir a busca (BrowseRelay)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Retransmite paquetes de busca dunha rede ou enderezo a outra.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: src-address dest-address</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:398
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Browse timeout (BrowseTimeout)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The timeout (in seconds) for network printers - if we don't\n"
"get an update within this time the printer will be removed\n"
"from the printer list.  This number definitely should not be\n"
"less the BrowseInterval value for obvious reasons.  Defaults\n"
"to 300 seconds.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: 300</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Tempo límite de desconexión (BrowseTimeout)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O tempo (en segundos) para impresoras de rede - se non se \n"
"obtén unha actualización neste tempo a impresora será retirada \n"
"da lista de impresoras. Este número nunca debe ser menor que \n"
"o valor de BrowseInterval por razóns evidentes. De maneira predeterminada \n"
"vale 300 segundos.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: 300</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:409
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Implicit classes (ImplicitClasses)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Whether or not to use implicit classes.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Printer classes can be specified explicitly in the classes.conf\n"
"file, implicitly based upon the printers available on the LAN, or\n"
"both.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"When ImplicitClasses is On, printers on the LAN with the same name\n"
"(e.g. Acme-LaserPrint-1000) will be put into a class with the same\n"
"name. This allows you to setup multiple redundant queues on a LAN\n"
"without a lot of administrative difficulties.  If a user sends a\n"
"job to Acme-LaserPrint-1000, the job will go to the first available\n"
"queue.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Enabled by default.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Clases implícitas (ImplicitClasses)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Determinar se se usan ou non clases implícitas.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"As clases de impresoras poden ser especificadas no ficheiro classes.conf, \n"
"de xeito implícito baseándose nas impresoras dispoñíbeis na LAN, ou \n"
"de ambas as dúas maneiras.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Cando ImplicitClasses está axustado a «On», as impresoras na LAN co mesmo \n"
"nome (ex. Acme-LaserPrint-1000) serán postas nunha clase co mesmo nome \n"
"Isto permite configurar múltiplas colas redundantes na LAN \n"
"sen ter moitas dificultades de administración. Se un usuario envía un \n"
"traballo a Acme-LaserPrint-1000, o traballo irá á primeira cola \n"
"dispoñíbel.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Activado de maneira predeterminada.</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:427
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>System group (SystemGroup)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The group name for \"System\" (printer administration)\n"
"access.  The default varies depending on the operating system, but\n"
"will be <b>sys</b>, <b>system</b>, or <b>root</b> (checked for in that "
"order).</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: sys</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Grupo de sistema (SystemGroup)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O nome de grupo para acceso a «Sistema» (administración de impresoras). \n"
"O valor predeterminado varía dependendo do sistema operativo, pero \n"
"será <b>sys</b>, <b>system</b>, ou <b>root</b> (comprobado nesa orde).</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: sys</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:436
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Encryption certificate (ServerCertificate)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The file to read containing the server's certificate.\n"
"Defaults to \"/etc/cups/ssl/server.crt\".</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: /etc/cups/ssl/server.crt</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Certificado de cifrado (ServerCertificate)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O ficheiro que contén o certificado do servidor. \n"
"De maneira predeterminada «/etc/cups/ssl/server.crt».</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: /etc/cups/ssl/server.crt</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:444
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Encryption key (ServerKey)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The file to read containing the server's key.\n"
"Defaults to \"/etc/cups/ssl/server.key\".</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: /etc/cups/ssl/server.key</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Chave de cifrado (ServerKey)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O ficheiro que contén a chave do servidor. \n"
"De maneira predeterminada «/etc/cups/ssl/server.key».</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: /etc/cups/ssl/server.key</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:452
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"Access permissions\n"
"# Access permissions for each directory served by the scheduler.\n"
"Locations are relative to DocumentRoot...\n"
"# AuthType: the authorization to use:\n"
"#    None   - Perform no authentication\n"
"Basic  - Perform authentication using the HTTP Basic method.\n"
"Digest - Perform authentication using the HTTP Digest method.\n"
"#    (Note: local certificate authentication can be substituted by\n"
"the client for Basic or Digest when connecting to the\n"
"localhost interface)\n"
"# AuthClass: the authorization class; currently only Anonymous, User,\n"
"System (valid user belonging to group SystemGroup), and Group\n"
"(valid user belonging to the specified group) are supported.\n"
"# AuthGroupName: the group name for \"Group\" authorization.\n"
"# Order: the order of Allow/Deny processing.\n"
"# Allow: allows access from the specified hostname, domain, IP address, or\n"
"network.\n"
"# Deny: denies access from the specified hostname, domain, IP address, or\n"
"network.\n"
"# Both \"Allow\" and \"Deny\" accept the following notations for addresses:\n"
"#     All\n"
"None\n"
"*.domain.com\n"
".domain.com\n"
"host.domain.com\n"
"nnn.*\n"
"nnn.nnn.*\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.*\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.nnn\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.nnn/mm\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.nnn/mmm.mmm.mmm.mmm\n"
"# The host and domain address require that you enable hostname lookups\n"
"with \"HostNameLookups On\" above.\n"
"# Encryption: whether or not to use encryption; this depends on having\n"
"the OpenSSL library linked into the CUPS library and scheduler.\n"
"# Possible values:\n"
"#     Always       - Always use encryption (SSL)\n"
"Never        - Never use encryption\n"
"Required     - Use TLS encryption upgrade\n"
"IfRequested  - Use encryption if the server requests it\n"
"# The default value is \"IfRequested\".\n"
msgstr ""
"Permisos de acceso\n"
"# Permisos de acceso para cada directorio servido polo planificador.\n"
"Enderezos relativos a DocumentRoot…\n"
"# AuthType: a autorización a usar:\n"
"#    None   - Non facer ningunha autenticación\n"
"Basic  - Autenticar usando o método HTTP básico.\n"
"Digest - Autenticar usando o método HTTP Digest.\n"
"#    (Nota: a autenticación con certificado local pode substituírse\n"
"no cliente por Basic ou Digest cando se conecte á interface\n"
"localhost)\n"
"# AuthClass: a clase de autorización; na actualidade só poden usarse "
"Anonymous, User,\n"
"System (usuario correcto pertencente ao grupo SystemGroup), e Group\n"
"(usuario correcto pertencente ao grupo especificado).\n"
"# AuthGroupName: o nome de grupo para a autorización de «Grupo».\n"
"# Order: a orde de procesamento Allow/Deny.\n"
"# Allow: permite o acceso desde a máquina, dominio, enderezo IP ou rede "
"especificado.\n"
"# Deny:  recusa o acceso desde a máquina, dominio, enderezo IP ou rede "
"especificado.\n"
"# Ambos os dous «Allow» e «Deny» aceptan as seguintes notacións para os "
"enderezos:\n"
"#     All\n"
"None\n"
"*.dominio.com\n"
".dominio.com\n"
"maquina.dominio.com\n"
"nnn.*\n"
"nnn.nnn.*\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.*\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.nnn\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.nnn/mm\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.nnn/mmm.mmm.mmm.mmm\n"
"# Os enderezos de máquina e dominio requiren que permita as buscas de nomes "
"mediante\n"
"«HostNameLookups On».\n"
"# Encryption: Usar ou non cifrado; isto depende de ter\n"
"a biblioteca OpenSSL ligada á biblioteca de CUPS e ao seu planificador.\n"
"#Valores Posíbeis:\n"
"#     Always       - Usar sempre cifrado (SSL)\n"
"Never        - Non cifrar nunca\n"
"Required     - Usar anovación de cifrado TLS\n"
"IfRequested  - Usar cifrado se o servidor o require\n"
"# O valor predeterminado é «IfRequested».\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:495
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Authentication (AuthType)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The authorization to use:<p>\n"
"<ul type=circle>\n"
"<li><i>None</i>   - Perform no authentication.</li>\n"
"<li><i>Basic</i>  - Perform authentication using the HTTP Basic method.</"
"li>\n"
"<li><i>Digest</i> - Perform authentication using the HTTP Digest method.</"
"li>\n"
"</ul><p>\n"
"Note: local certificate authentication can be substituted by\n"
"the client for <i>Basic</i> or <i>Digest</i> when connecting to the\n"
"localhost interface.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Autenticación (AuthType)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"A autorización para usar:<p>\n"
"<ul type=circle>\n"
"<li><i>None</i>   -Non se autentica.</li>\n"
"<li><i>Basic</i>  - Autenticar mediante o método HTTP Basic.</li>\n"
"<li><i>Digest</i> - Autenticar mediante o método HTTP Digest.</li>\n"
"</ul><p>\n"
"Nota: os certificados locais de autenticación poden ser substituídos \n"
"polo cliente por <i>Basic</i> ou <i>Digest</i> cando se conecten pola \n"
"interface localhost.</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:508
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Class (AuthClass)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The authorization class; currently only <i>Anonymous</i>, <i>User</i>,\n"
"<i>System</i> (valid user belonging to group SystemGroup), and <i>Group</i>\n"
"(valid user belonging to the specified group) are supported.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Clase (AuthClass)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"A clase de autorización; na actualidade só se permiten \n"
"<i>Anonymous</i>, <i>User</i>, <i>System</i> (usuario correcto \n"
"pertencente ao grupo SystemGroup), e <i>Group</i>\n"
"(usuario correcto pertencente ao grupo especificado).</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:515
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<p>The user/group names allowed to access the resource. The format is a\n"
"comma separated list.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Os nomes de usuario/grupo a quen se lles permite acceder ao recurso. \n"
"O formato é unha lista delimitada por comas.</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:519
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Satisfy (Satisfy)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"This directive controls whether all specified conditions must\n"
"be satisfied to allow access to the resource. If set to \"all\",\n"
"then all authentication and access control conditions must be\n"
"satisfied to allow access.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Setting Satisfy to \"any\" allows a user to gain access if the\n"
"authentication <i>or</i> access control requirements are satisfied.\n"
"For example, you might require authentication for remote access,\n"
"but allow local access without authentication.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The default is \"all\".\n"
"</p> \n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Satisfacer (Satisfy)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Esta directiva controla se todas as condicións especificadas \n"
"deben ser satisfeitas para permitir acceso ao recurso. Se ten o valor \n"
"«all», entón deberán satisfacerse todas as condicións de acceso \n"
"e autenticación para permitir o acceso.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Axustándoa a «any» permítelle a un usuario acceder de satisfacerse \n"
"os requirimentos de autenticación <i>ou</i> control de acceso. \n"
"Por exemplo, pode requirir autenticación para acceso remoto, \n"
"pero permitir acceso local sen autenticación.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O valor predeterminado é «all».\n"
"</p> \n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:537
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Authentication group name (AuthGroupName)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The group name for <i>Group</i> authorization.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Nome do grupo de autenticación (AuthGroupName)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O nome de grupo para autorización de <i>Grupo</i>.</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:542
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>ACL order (Order)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The order of Allow/Deny processing.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Orde da ACL (Order)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"A orde de procesamento de Allow/Deny.</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:547
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Allow</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Allows access from the specified hostname, domain, IP address, or\n"
"network. Possible values are:</p>\n"
"<pre>\n"
"All\n"
"None\n"
"*.domain.com\n"
".domain.com\n"
"host.domain.com\n"
"nnn.*\n"
"nnn.nnn.*\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.*\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.nnn\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.nnn/mm\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.nnn/mmm.mmm.mmm.mmm\n"
"</pre><p>\n"
"The host and domain address require that you enable hostname lookups\n"
"with \"HostNameLookups On\" above.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Allow</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Permite acceder desde a máquina, dominio, enderezo IP ou rede especificado. "
"\n"
"Os valores posíbeis son:</p>\n"
"<pre>\n"
"All\n"
"None\n"
"*.dominio.com\n"
".dominio.com\n"
"maquina.dominio.com\n"
"nnn.*\n"
"nnn.nnn.*\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.*\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.nnn\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.nnn/mm\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.nnn/mmm.mmm.mmm.mmm\n"
"</pre><p>\n"
"O enderezo de máquina e dominio requiren que permita buscas de nomes\n"
"mediante «HostNameLookups On».</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:568
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>ACL addresses (Allow/Deny)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Allows/Denies access from the specified hostname, domain, IP address, or\n"
"network. Possible values are:</p>\n"
"<pre>\n"
"All\n"
"None\n"
"*.domain.com\n"
".domain.com\n"
"host.domain.com\n"
"nnn.*\n"
"nnn.nnn.*\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.*\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.nnn\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.nnn/mm\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.nnn/mmm.mmm.mmm.mmm\n"
"</pre><p>\n"
"The host and domain address require that you enable hostname lookups\n"
"with \"HostNameLookups On\" above.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Enderezos ACL (Allow/Deny)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Permite/Denega o acceso desde a  máquina, dominio, enderezo IP ou rede \n"
"especificado. Os valores posíbeis son:</p>\n"
"<pre>\n"
"All\n"
"None\n"
"*.dominio.com\n"
".dominio.com\n"
"maquina.dominio.com\n"
"nnn.*\n"
"nnn.nnn.*\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.*\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.nnn\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.nnn/mm\n"
"nnn.nnn.nnn.nnn/mmm.mmm.mmm.mmm\n"
"</pre><p>\n"
"O enderezo de máquina e dominio requiren que permita buscas de nomes\n"
"mediante «HostNameLookups On».</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:589
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Encryption (Encryption)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Whether or not to use encryption; this depends on having\n"
"the OpenSSL library linked into the CUPS library and scheduler.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Possible values:</p>\n"
"<ul type=circle>\n"
"<li><i>Always</i>       - Always use encryption (SSL)</li>\n"
"<li><i>Never</i>        - Never use encryption</li>\n"
"<li><i>Required</i>     - Use TLS encryption upgrade</li>\n"
"<li><i>IfRequested</i>  - Use encryption if the server requests it</li>\n"
"</ul><p>\n"
"The default value is \"IfRequested\".</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Cifrado (Encryption)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Usar ou non cifrado; isto depende de ter \n"
"a biblioteca OpenSSL ligada á biblioteca de CUPS e ao planificador.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Os valores posíbeis son:</p>\n"
"<ul type=circle>\n"
"<li><i>Always</i>       - Cifrar sempre (SSL)</li>\n"
"<li><i>Never</i>        - Non cifrar nunca</li>\n"
"<li><i>Required</i>     - Usar a anovación de cifrado TLS</li>\n"
"<li><i>IfRequested</i>  - Usar cifrado se o servidor o require</li>\n"
"</ul><p>\n"
"O valor predeterminado é «IfRequested».</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:604
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Access permissions</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Access permissions for each directory served by the scheduler.\n"
"Locations are relative to DocumentRoot...</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Permisos de acceso</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Permisos de acceso para cada directorio servido polo planificador.\n"
"As localizacións son relativas a DocumentRoot…</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:610
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Auto purge jobs (AutoPurgeJobs)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Automatically purge jobs when not needed for quotas.\n"
"Default is No.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Purgar automaticamente os traballos (AutoPurgeJobs)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Borrar automaticamente traballos cando non son precisos para cotas.\n"
"De maneira predeterminada é Non.</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:616
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Browse protocols (BrowseProtocols)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Which protocols to use for browsing.  Can be\n"
"any of the following separated by whitespace and/or commas:</p>\n"
"<ul type=circle>\n"
"<li><i>all</i>  - Use all supported protocols.</li>\n"
"<li><i>cups</i> - Use the CUPS browse protocol.</li>\n"
"<li><i>slp</i>  - Use the SLPv2 protocol.</li>\n"
"</ul><p>\n"
"The default is <b>cups</b>.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Note: If you choose to use SLPv2, it is <b>strongly</b> recommended that\n"
"you have at least one SLP Directory Agent (DA) on your\n"
"network.  Otherwise, browse updates can take several seconds,\n"
"during which the scheduler will not response to client\n"
"requests.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Protocolos de navegación (BrowseProtocols)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Os protocolos a usar para a navegación. Poden ser \n"
"calquera dos seguintes separados por un espazo e/ou comas:</p>\n"
"<ul type=circle>\n"
"<li><i>all</i>  - Usar todos os protocolos permitidos.</li>\n"
"<li><i>cups</i> - Usar o protocolo de navegación de CUPS.</li>\n"
"<li><i>slp</i>  - Usar o protocolo SLPv2.</li>\n"
"</ul><p>\n"
"O valor predeterminado é <b>cups</b>.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Nota: Se escolle usar SLPv2, recoméndaselle <b>encarecidamente</b> que\n"
"teña polo menos un Axente de Directorio SLP (DA) na súa\n"
"rede.  De outra maneira, as actualizacións de navegación poden levar varios "
"segundos,\n"
"durante os cales o planificador non responderá ás peticións do cliente.</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:634
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Classification (Classification)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The classification level of the server.  If set, this\n"
"classification is displayed on all pages, and raw printing is disabled.\n"
"The default is the empty string.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>ex</i>: confidential\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Clasificación (Classification)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O nivel de clasificación do servidor. Se está configurada, esta \n"
"clasificación móstrase en todas as páxinas, e a \n"
"impresión en bruto está desactivada. O valor predeterminado é unha cadea "
"baleira.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<i>exemplo</i>: confidential\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:643
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Allow overrides (ClassifyOverride)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Whether to allow users to override the classification\n"
"on printouts. If enabled, users can limit banner pages to before or\n"
"after the job, and can change the classification of a job, but cannot\n"
"completely eliminate the classification or banners.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The default is off.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Ignorar a clasificación (ClassifyOverride)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Permitir que os usuarios salten a clasificación \n"
"das impresións. De permitirse, os usuarios poderán limitar as páxinas \n"
"de separación a antes ou despois do traballo, e poderán cambiar a \n"
"clasificación dun traballo, pero non poderán eliminar por completo \n"
"a clasificación nin os rótulos.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O valor predeterminado é «off».</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:653
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Hide implicit members (HideImplicitMembers)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Whether or not to show the members of an\n"
"implicit class.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"When HideImplicitMembers is On, any remote printers that are\n"
"part of an implicit class are hidden from the user, who will\n"
"then only see a single queue even though many queues will be\n"
"supporting the implicit class.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Enabled by default.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Agochar os membros implícitos (HideImplicitMembers)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Mostrar ou non os membros dunha clase implícita.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Cando HideImplicitMembers está en «On», calquera impresoras remotas \n"
"que sexan parte dunha clase implícita estarán agochadas ao usuario, que só \n"
"verá unha única cola mesmo se houber varias colas sostendo a clase implícita."
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Activado de maneira predeterminada.</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:666
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Use &quot;any&quot; classes (ImplicitAnyClasses)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Whether or not to create <b>AnyPrinter</b> implicit\n"
"classes.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"When ImplicitAnyClasses is On and a local queue of the same name\n"
"exists, e.g. \"printer\", \"printer@server1\", \"printer@server1\", then\n"
"an implicit class called \"Anyprinter\" is created instead.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"When ImplicitAnyClasses is Off, implicit classes are not created\n"
"when there is a local queue of the same name.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Disabled by default.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Usar &quot;calquera&quot; clase (ImplicitAnyClasses)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Crear ou non clases implícitas <b>AnyPrinter</b>.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Cando ImplicitAnyClasses está en «On» e existe unha cola local co mesmo "
"nome, ex. «impresora», «impresora@servidor1», \n"
"«impresora@servidor1», entón crearase no seu lugar unha clase \n"
"implícita chamada «Anyprinter».</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Cando ImplicitAnyClasses está en «Off», non se crean clases \n"
"implícitas cando hai unha fila local co mesmo nome.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Desactivado de maneira predeterminada.</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:681
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Max jobs (MaxJobs)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Maximum number of jobs to keep in memory (active and completed).\n"
"Default is 0 (no limit).</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Número máximo de traballos (MaxJobs)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Número máximo de traballos a manter na memoria (activos e completos).\n"
"De maneira predeterminada é 0 (sen límite).</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:687
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Max jobs per user (MaxJobsPerUser)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The MaxJobsPerUser directive controls the maximum number of <i>active</i>\n"
"jobs that are allowed for each user. Once a user reaches the limit, new\n"
"jobs will be rejected until one of the active jobs is completed, stopped,\n"
"aborted, or canceled.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Setting the maximum to 0 disables this functionality.\n"
"Default is 0 (no limit).\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Número máximo de traballos por usuario (MaxJobsPerUser)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"A directiva MaxJobsPerUser controla o número máximo de traballos \n"
"<i>activos</i> permitidos por cada usuario. Cando un usuario acada \n"
"o límite, os novos traballos serán rexeitados ata que un dos activos \n"
"se complete, pare, aborte, ou sexa cancelado</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Axustar o máximo a 0 desactiva esta funcionalidade. \n"
"De maneira predeterminada é 0 (sen límite).\n"
"</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:699
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Max jobs per printer (MaxJobsPerPrinter)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The MaxJobsPerPrinter directive controls the maximum number of <i>active</"
"i>\n"
"jobs that are allowed for each printer or class. Once a printer or class\n"
"reaches the limit, new jobs will be rejected until one of the active jobs\n"
"is completed, stopped, aborted, or canceled.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Setting the maximum to 0 disables this functionality.\n"
"Default is 0 (no limit).\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Número máximo de traballos por impresora (MaxJobsPerPrinter)</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"A directiva MaxJobsPerPrinter controla o máximo número de traballos \n"
"<i>activos</i> permitidos a cada impresora ou clase. Cando unha\n"
"impresora ou clase acade o límite, os novos traballos serán \n"
"rexeitados ata que un dos traballos activos se complete, pare, \n"
"aborte, ou sexa cancelado.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Axustar o máximo a 0 desactiva esta funcionalidade. \n"
"De maneira predeterminada é 0 (sen límite).\n"
"</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:711
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Port</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The port value that the CUPS daemon is listening to. Default is 631.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Porto</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O número de porto no que o daemon de CUPS está a escoitar. \n"
"De maneira predeterminada é 631.</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:716
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<b>Address</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The address that the CUPS daemon is listening at. Leave it empty or use\n"
"an asterisk (*) to specify a port value on the entire subnetwork.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<b>Enderezo</b>\n"
"<p>\n"
"O enderezo no que escoita o daemon de CUPS. Déixeo baleiro ou use \n"
"un asterisco (*) para especificar un porto en toda a subrede.</p>\n"

#: cupsd.conf.template.cpp:722
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"Do not translate the keyword between brackets (e.g. ServerName, ServerAdmin, "
"etc.)"
msgid ""
"<p>Check this box if you want to use SSL encryption with this address/port.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Marque esta opción se quere usar cifrado SSL con este enderezo/porto.</"
"p>\n"

